{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When Livia Disappeared </strong>is a narrative-driven fantasy visual novel set in a magickal 1920s urban world. Players explore, craft mind-altering elixirs, and perform rituals to uncover a shared childhood trauma. Featuring deep relationship-building, multiple story routes, and mature themes of magick, memory, and survival, the game offers high replayability and a richly immersive experience with a diverse cast and complex characters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the dark secrets of the members of the Order \u2013 and those who oppose it</strong><br>Three different, branching character routes will lead you to uncover not only their demons, but also your own suppressed memories. How far you are willing to go for what you believe in, for others\u2019 expectations, and for finding somewhere to belong?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442430/extras/df4e87e123bd17cfbf129ce95fb1f3ab.avif?t=1773317014\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442430/extras_big/df4e87e123bd17cfbf129ce95fb1f3ab.avif?t=1773317014 width=800 height=402 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the beauty and danger of rituals</strong><br>Create and perform rituals inspired by ceremonial Magick, and deal with the consequences of how it changes the worlds around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442430/extras/1ff9bdc63a45530dd816cca31f813abf.avif?t=1773317014\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442430/extras_big/1ff9bdc63a45530dd816cca31f813abf.avif?t=1773317014 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft potions and experience their effects</strong><br>Mix potions from mystical ingredients, and experience how they change your perception of the world on the Other Side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442430/extras/20bb901ed46c1a036c05d3a88db56648.avif?t=1773317014\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442430/extras_big/20bb901ed46c1a036c05d3a88db56648.avif?t=1773317014 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3442430?t=1773317014","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442430/089dcd8b35acb68dc24208ef43e516f03b1ec4f1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773317014","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442430/265d24cbd4bd66911f935d5b8f454d5f403fa911/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773317014","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442430/265d24cbd4bd66911f935d5b8f454d5f403fa911/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773317014","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains references to death, grief, trauma, and mental distress. It includes fictional depictions of ritual practices, mild fantasy violence, and the use of alchemical elixirs.\r\n\r\nCertain story paths explore emotionally intense topics, including implied manipulation and coercion."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When Livia Disappeared </strong>is a narrative-driven fantasy visual novel set in a magickal 1920s urban world. Players explore, craft mind-altering elixirs, and perform rituals to uncover a shared childhood trauma. Featuring deep relationship-bu